            <title>[LU-20574] utils: tunefs.lustre --quota silently discards the options stored in the LDD</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20574</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;tunefs.lustre --quota enables quota accounting on the backing filesystem and then returns immediately, so osd_write_ldd() is never reached:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
        &lt;span class="code-comment"&gt;/* Enable quota accounting */&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (mop.mo_flags &amp;amp; MO_QUOTA) {
                ret = osd_enable_quota(&amp;amp;mop);
                &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;goto&lt;/span&gt; out;
        }write:#endif &lt;span class="code-comment"&gt;/* !TUNEFS */&lt;/span&gt;        &lt;span class="code-comment"&gt;/* Write our config files */&lt;/span&gt;
        ret = osd_write_ldd(&amp;amp;mop);
        &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (ret != 0) {
                fatal();
                fprintf(stderr, &lt;span class="code-quote"&gt;"failed to write local files\n"&lt;/span&gt;);
                &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;goto&lt;/span&gt; out;
        }
out:
        osd_fini();
        ret2 = loop_cleanup(&amp;amp;mop);
        &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (ret == 0)
                ret = ret2; &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reproduce steps:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
# tunefs.lustre --quota --comment=test /dev/nvme1n1
checking &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; existing Lustre data: found   Read previous values:
Device:     /dev/nvme1n1
Target:     test-MDT0001
Index:      1
Lustre FS:  test
Mount type: ldiskfs
Flags:      0x1
              (MDT )
Persistent mount opts: user_xattr,errors=remount-ro
Parameters: mgsnode=172.16.46.134@tcp
   Permanent disk data:
Device:     /dev/nvme1n1
Target:     test-MDT0001
Index:      1
Lustre FS:  test
Mount type: ldiskfs
Flags:      0x1
              (MDT )
Persistent mount opts: user_xattr,errors=remount-ro
Parameters: mgsnode=172.16.46.134@tcp
Comment: testQuota feature is already enabled.
# tunefs.lustre /dev/nvme1n1
checking &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; existing Lustre data: found   Read previous values:
Device:     /dev/nvme1n1
Target:     test-MDT0001
Index:      1
Lustre FS:  test
Mount type: ldiskfs
Flags:      0x1
              (MDT )
Persistent mount opts: user_xattr,errors=remount-ro
Parameters: mgsnode=172.16.46.134@tcpexiting because there is no change. &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
